A battery of electromotive force (e.m.f.) $8.0\text{ V}$ and internal resistance $2.0\Omega$ is connected to a resistor X and a wire Y, as shown in Fig. 6.1.

{{figure:figure_6_1.png}}

The resistance of X is $15\Omega$. The resistance of Y is $R_{Y}$. The current in the battery is $2.5\text{ A}$.
